# admin-via-sample-pool -- reach Admin INDIRECTLY, arriving from the sample pool.
# [stol:ui-planner-cov-starts] From a boot start A* reaches admin in ONE op
# (nav_home_to_admin), so nav_sample_pool_to_admin is never routed; declaring the
# start as the sample pool forces that sample_pool->admin return edge -- the only
# way to cover it. The SETUP route home->admin->sample_pool (nav_home_to_admin,
# nav_admin_to_sample_pool) is driven first at --run but is NOT part of this
# measured plan.
# start: context(sample_pool)
context(admin)
